---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms & Disclaimer | Pakistan Finance Calculators"
  description="Terms and disclaimer for Pakistan Finance Calculators: results are estimates only, not tax, financial, or religious advice."
  slug="/terms/"
>
  <div class="container prose-narrow" style="padding-top:40px;">
    <h1>Terms &amp; Disclaimer</h1>
    <p>
      All calculators on this site provide estimates for information
      only. They are not tax advice, financial advice, or religious
      rulings. Confirm important decisions with a qualified tax
      professional, financial adviser, or scholar before acting.
    </p>
    <h2>Tax</h2>
    <p>
      The Salary / Income Tax Calculator applies salaried slabs for
      2026-27 to taxable income only, before any surcharge, rebate, or
      withholding adjustment. The slab citation is to be verified
      against the Finance Act gazette before launch; until then the
      page says so plainly.
    </p>
    <h2>Zakat</h2>
    <p>
      The Zakat Calculator is an arithmetic estimate only, not a fatwa.
      Zakat method, nisab, and asset eligibility can differ by school
      of thought. Confirm with a qualified scholar before paying.
    </p>
    <h2>Currency and gold</h2>
    <p>
      Currency and gold figures are indicative rates and prices, not
      bank, exchange, or Sarafa jeweller rates. Banks and jewellers may
      differ, and fees, making charges, wastage, and taxes are not
      included. Stale figures are labelled with their last-updated time.
    </p>
    <h2>Land area</h2>
    <p>
      The Unit / Marla Converter defaults to the Punjab revenue
      definition of marla and kanal (272.25 sq ft per marla), labelled
      provisional until a named source confirms it, and offers the
      housing-society definition (225 sq ft per marla, DHA / Bahria /
      LDA) as a choice. Marla sizes can differ by region and scheme;
      check local records for legal or transaction use.
    </p>
    <h2>Use of the site</h2>
    <p>
      The tools inform; they do not transact. Do not use them to file
      tax, pay Zakat, buy currency, or buy gold. The site is provided
      as-is, without warranties, to the extent allowed by law.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
